# Didox purchase with VAT

Column **«Етказиб беришнинг ҚҚСни ҳисобга олган ҳолда қиймати»** → role `PURCHASE_WITH_VAT` (line sum with VAT).

- Divide by qty → unit `purchasePriceWithVat`; derive ex-VAT via `withoutVat`.
- When this column is present it **wins over** «Сотиб олиш / базавий» — do not use unit×ҚҚС% or base cost instead.
- Do **not** SKIP all «етказиб» headers; only the without-VAT «Етказиб бериш қиймати» stays SKIP.
- Confirm must pass file `purchasePriceWithVat` into the receipt line (no `withVat(purchase, vat)` overwrite).
- Product already on **this** draft → `MATCHED`, confirm **adds qty** to the existing line (not block as DUPLICATE).
